.TH ALI-SENTINEL 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-sentinel \- drive the Sentinel IDS/IPS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-sentinel
.RI [ status | events | blocked | unblock\ ip | learn | check | kill\ pid ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B status
shows daemon state, exterminated-IP count and recent events.
.B blocked
lists firewall blocks.
.B unblock
frees an IP.
.B learn
re-trusts current ports/files.
.B check
runs one scan now.
.B kill
terminates a suspicious PID (never 1).
Turkish with ALI_LANG=tr.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sentinel (8),
.BR oracle (8)
